WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
Choose the original teaching character in Asset library. It is an imported diagram, not a generated output.

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.453
Choose Combine and the picture-compatible Copy Pose recipe. No skeleton or depth-map route is used.

3
00:00:08.453 --> 00:00:13.803
Read the actual roles: keep the character as image 1; the pose-board picture becomes image 2.

4
00:00:13.803 --> 00:00:18.992
Attach the original pose diagram to the pose board. The character stays in Picture to keep.

5
00:00:18.992 --> 00:00:24.045
Describe who to keep, their clothes and colours, and the target pose. These fields write an editable instruction.

6
00:00:24.045 --> 00:00:28.169
Review the board count and Picture to keep. These inputs only prepare a pair; no pose-transfer quality is proved.

7
00:00:28.169 --> 00:00:32.267
Read the actual readiness warning. Stop without Generate; the backend remains unavailable.

